<view wx:if="{{food}}" class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">SHARE YOUR TASTY MOMENT</view><view class="title">这一口<text class="accent">，</text>你说了算</view><view class="subtitle">用真实感受，帮大家发现更多好味道</view></view><view class="panel"><view class="review-shop"><image src="{{food.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><view class="section-title">{{food.name}}</view><text class="tag">{{food.category}}</text><text class="muted"> · ¥{{food.price}}/人</text></view></view><view class="divider"/><view class="rating-label">这次探店体验怎么样？</view><view class="rating-stars"><button wx:for="{{stars}}" wx:key="value" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="selectRating" class="rating-star {{item.filled?'lit':''}}" aria-label="{{item.value}}星">★</button></view><view class="rating-hint">{{labels[rating]}}</view></view><view class="panel"><view class="field-label">评价昵称</view><input class="nickname-input" value="{{nickname}}" maxlength="16" bindinput="inputNickname" placeholder="请输入昵称"/><view class="field-label">分享你的美食体验</view><textarea value="{{content}}" maxlength="300" bindinput="inputContent" placeholder="口味、环境、服务… 哪一点让你印象深刻？"/><view class="word-count">{{content.length}} / 300</view><view class="muted">{{time}} · 提交时记录实际发表时间</view></view><button class="primary submit" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{submitting}}" loading="{{submitting}}">发布评价</button><view class="footer-note">每一份认真分享，都是下一次美味的开始</view></view><view wx:else class="empty"><text class="empty-art">🍽️</text><view class="empty-title">店铺不存在</view><button class="primary" bindtap="goHome">返回首页</button></view>
